i Central Highway, melawat Lawang Sewu, shopping oleh-oleh Pandanaran. Penginapan di Semarang.","mealIncluded":["B","L","D"]},{"dayNumber":5,"title":"Semarang - Jogja Merapi Tour","description":"Photo stop di Borobudur Temple, Merapi Jeep Tour, shopping di Jalan Malioboro. Penginapan di Jogja.","mealIncluded":["B","L","D"]},{"dayNumber":6,"title":"Jogjakarta - Bromo","description":"Perjalanan ke Bromo melalui Highway, melawat kawasan lumpur Lapindo di Sidoarjo, shopping barangan kulit di Tanggulangin, free and easy. Penginapan di kawasan pergunungan Bromo.","mealIncluded":["B","L","D"]},{"dayNumber":7,"title":"Bromo - Malang - Surabaya","description":"Bromo Sunrise – Semeru Lawang – Savana Tour, shopping di Ole-Ole Batu Malang, melawat perkebunan epal. Penginapan di Surabaya.","mealIncluded":["B","L","D"]},{"dayNumber":8,"title":"Surabaya Full Day Tour - Madura","description":"Melawat Monumen Kapal Selam, foto kenangan di Tugu Surabaya, shopping di PGS dan ITC, lawatan singkat ke Madura melalui Suramadu. Penginapan di Surabaya.","mealIncluded":["B","L","D"]},{"dayNumber":9,"title":"Surabaya - Kuala Lumpur","description":"Transfer ke airport untuk penerbangan pulang ke Kuala Lumpur.","mealIncluded":["B"]}]}},{"id":"blk-price-h","kind":"heading","value":"Harga"},{"id":"blk-price","kind":"pricing","value":"Harga","data":{"rows":[{"label":"Dewasa (12+)","amount":"RM 2,999"},{"label":"Kanak-kanak (2–11)","amount":"RM 2,799"},{"label":"Bayi (bawah 2)","amount":"RM 500"}]}},{"id":"blk-inc-h","kind":"heading","value":"Termasuk & Tidak Termasuk"},{"id":"blk-inc","kind":"list","value":"TERMASUK: Tiket penerbangan pergi balik|TERMASUK: Tiket keretapi|TERMASUK: Makan minum sesuai aturcara|TERMASUK: Pengangkutan sepanjang program|TERMASUK: 8 malam penginapan|TERMASUK: Pemandu pelancongan|TERMASUK: Bayaran masuk tempat lawatan|TERMASUK: Air mineral dalam bas|TERMASUK: Insuran Group|TERMASUK: Bagasi 20KG|TIDAK TERMASUK: Perbelanjaan peribadi|TIDAK TERMASUK: Tipping RM180/seorang|T